cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GPT-Flux: A Domain-Specialized Chinese Q&A Model for Geoscience and Flux-Tower Research"
message: "If you use GPT-Flux in your research, please cite it as follows."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Wang"
    given-names: "Longhao"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/LonghaoWang/GPT-Flux"
url: "https://huggingface.co/LonghaoWang/flux-gpt-qwen3-14b-merged"
abstract: >-
  GPT-Flux is Qwen3-14B fine-tuned with QLoRA on 6,175 Chinese question-answer
  pairs synthesized from 1,609 peer-reviewed geoscience and eddy-covariance
  flux-tower papers, producing a professional knowledge assistant for
  carbon-water-energy flux research.
keywords:
  - eddy-covariance
  - flux-tower
  - geoscience
  - large-language-models
  - QLoRA
  - fine-tuning
  - Chinese-NLP
